# Live smoke test (tools/live_smoke.sh, docs/ci.md "Live smoke tests"): NPCs.
# Hail an NPC, trade it an item it has no use for (PEQ's guards hand it back), and kill an NPC with #damage.
# Stock PEQ's Qeynos Hills; any GM character.
zone qeytoqrg
say #summonitem 13005
wait 2
hail Guard
expect-chat Hail, Guard
give Guard 13005
expect-chat you can have it back
expect-item 13005
kill rat
